{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05668","headline":"故陈州刺史赠兵部尚书韦公挽词 · 孙逖","name":"故陈州刺史赠兵部尚书韦公挽词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奕叶金章贵，连枝鼎位尊。\n台庭爲凤穴，相府是鴒原。\n世阅空悲命，泉幽不返魂。\n惟余汉臣史，继术赞韦门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}